{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASMBL is a multiplayer VR sandbox game where you challenge your friends with huge assemblies you create yourself. Pilot your own land, air, and space vehicles. Compete head-to-head with your friends. From elegant machines to utterly ridiculous contraptions - the only limit is your imagination! Collaborate and share designs with friends online. Build your own avatars to freely express yourself. Experience building like you never have before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in Closed Beta, and not all features are implemented. This Beta is to gain feedback to make each subsystem robust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to share your designs and give us feedback: .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hands to grab and assemble parts. When parts are moved close together, suggestions for where to place the part will appear. Let go to attach the part. Easy as that! Enter your designs in contests of agility and durability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited number of designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motors, pistons, servos, wheels, wings, propellers, rockets, gyroscopes, suction cups, proximity sensors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine gun, Rocket launcher, Blaster, Missile launcher, and Laser cannon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game controllers, steering wheels, HOTAS joysticks, Tank steering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable avatars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your designs with others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics playgrounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 part types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 unique materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive 3D environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer builder and simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own VR avatars</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2582250?t=1771191700","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582250/69302b6200faa70a3868b7ab69e1bc6e29f78cb6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771191700","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582250/5edc5b84a2f7a2b049f85d064c0cd98a0cf19a15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771191700","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582250/5edc5b84a2f7a2b049f85d064c0cd98a0cf19a15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771191700","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASMBL is a multiplayer VR sandbox game where you challenge your friends with huge assemblies you create yourself. Pilot your own land, air, and space vehicles. Compete head-to-head with your friends. From elegant machines to utterly ridiculous contraptions - the only limit is your imagination! Collaborate and share designs with friends online. Build your own avatars to freely express yourself. Experience building like you never have before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in Closed Beta, and not all features are implemented. This Beta is to gain feedback to make each subsystem robust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to share your designs and give us feedback: .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hands to grab and assemble parts. When parts are moved close together, suggestions for where to place the part will appear. Let go to attach the part. Easy as that! Enter your designs in contests of agility and durability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited number of designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motors, pistons, servos, wheels, wings, propellers, rockets, gyroscopes, suction cups, proximity sensors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine gun, Rocket launcher, Blaster, Missile launcher, and Laser cannon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game controllers, steering wheels, HOTAS joysticks, Tank steering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable avatars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your designs with others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics playgrounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 part types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 unique materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive 3D environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer builder and simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own VR avatars</p></li></ul>","developers":["Zach Bisoffi-Harris"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic